### List of user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List a user's invites
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/{{userId}}/invites
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Respond to an invite: currently returns 501 until authentication is implemented
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/invites/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACCEPTED"
}
